# Comptes, rôles, permissions, journal d'audit. Lancer d'abord la connexion (admin-auth.http).

### Catalogue des permissions (iam.roles.read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Rôles (iam.roles.read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Créer un rôle (iam.roles.manage)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "support-n1",
  "description": "Support niveau 1",
  "permissions": ["iam.users.read", "audit.read"]
}

> {% client.global.set("roleId", response.body.id); %}

### Modifier un rôle (iam.roles.manage)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/roles/{{roleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "permissions": ["iam.users.read"] }

### Comptes (iam.users.read)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Créer un compte (iam.users.create)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/users
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "support@example.com",
  "display_name": "Support",
  "password": "change me at first login"
}

> {% client.global.set("userId", response.body.id); %}

### Attribuer des rôles (iam.roles.assign)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/users/{{userId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "role_ids": ["{{roleId}}"] }

### Désactiver un compte (iam.users.update)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/users/{{userId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "disabled": true }

### Journal d'audit (audit.read) — la consultation est elle-même journalisée
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/admin/v1/audit?limit=20
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
